...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

budget: BudgetAnalysisAgent { class: ours }
savings: SavingsStrategyAgent { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }

budget -> savings: 같은 세션으로 다음 순서 진행
savings -> gemini: 모델 호출 (SavingsStrategy 스키마)
gemini -> savings: JSON 응답 → state.savings_strategy
